ial assumptions and their applicable evidence; distinguish verified facts, unresolved assumptions and accepted risks.\",\"required\":true,\"kind\":\"judgment\",\"profiles\":[\"engineering-judgment@1\",\"high-criticality-review@1\"]},{\"id\":\"backend-concurrency\",\"description\":\"Concurrent access, cancellation and lifecycle behavior are safe where applicable.\",\"required\":true,\"kind\":\"mechanical\",\"rules\":[\"backend-go\"],\"evidence_classes\":[\"e2e\",\"integration\",\"unit\"],\"profiles\":[\"backend-review@1\"]},{\"id\":\"backend-contracts\",\"description\":\"Public API, event, file and tool contracts remain compatible or explicitly migrated.\",\"required\":true,\"kind\":\"mechanical\",\"rules\":[\"backend-go\"],\"evidence_classes\":[\"e2e\",\"integration\"],\"profiles\":[\"backend-review@1\"]},{\"id\":\"backend-input-errors\",\"description\":\"Inputs, validation failures and error paths are bounded, typed and actionable.\",\"required\":true,\"kind\":\"mechanical\",\"rules\":[\"backend-go\",\"security\"],\"evidence_classes\":[\"e2e\",\"integration\",\"unit\"],\"profiles\":[\"backend-review@1\"]},{\"id\":\"backend-integration-impact\",\"description\":\"Providers, consumers and inter-component boundaries remain integrated.\",\"required\":true,\"kind\":\"mechanical\",\"evidence_classes\":[\"integration\"],\"profiles\":[\"backend-review@1\"]},{\"id\":\"backend-observability\",\"description\":\"Failures are diagnosable through bounded, non-sensitive logs, metrics or returned context.\",\"required\":true,\"kind\":\"mechanical\",\"rules\":[\"backend-go\",\"security\"],\"evidence_classes\":[\"integration\",\"unit\"],\"profiles\":[\"backend-review@1\"]},{\"id\":\"compatibility\",\"description\":\"Public CLI, file and MCP contracts are compatible or explicitly migrated.\",\"required\":true,\"kind\":\"judgment\",\"profiles\":[\"spec-closeout@1\"]},{\"id\":\"correctness\",\"description\":\"Functional and negative behavior is correct.\",\"required\":true,\"kind\":\"me